    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the controllable chaos of a neighborhood where danger lurks around every corner and bullets fly! It's an all-out shootout! In this third-person shooter, you won't face zombies or space monsters, but rather the most real enemies: on-duty thugs and corrupt politicians trying to ruin the community's day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>4 unique characters</strong>, each with their own arsenal and style to take down the bad guys\u2014a true gunpowder party!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission?</strong> <strong>Defend the local school at all costs!</strong> With each wave, groups of ill-intentioned individuals will come in force. But don't worry, you're not alone! Use your &quot;luletas&quot; to improve the school's defenses, transforming it into an impenetrable fortress... or almost!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the controllable chaos of a neighborhood where danger lurks around every corner and bullets fly! It's an all-out shootout! In this third-person shooter, you won't face zombies or space monsters, but rather the most real enemies: on-duty thugs and corrupt politicians trying to ruin the community's day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>4 unique characters</strong>, each with their own arsenal and style to take down the bad guys\u2014a true gunpowder party!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission?</strong> <strong>Defend the local school at all costs!</strong> With each wave, groups of ill-intentioned individuals will come in force. But don't worry, you're not alone! Use your &quot;luletas&quot; to improve the school's defenses, transforming it into an impenetrable fortress... or almost!</p>",
    "short_description": "Get ready to defend a school in a different Turrent Defense, where you defend and attack! Choose between 4 heroes and fight against bandits and corrupt politicians. Improve your defenses and get ready for lots of shooting, in this third-person action game!",
